# Ambient normal inversion and reconstruction coefficients

The actual inverse in `app:ch_waves:eq:ambient-normal-inverse` is constructed
from the second jet, identified on the symmetric stress orthogonal complement,
and bounded with one high map norm and fixed reserve two. The full field in
`app:ch_waves:eq:reconstruction` has a joint one-high bound with two derivatives
of the immersion and one of the covector, uniformly on compact low-jet ranges.
